{"id":"nce1-049","book":"nce1","numbers":[49,50],"label":"Lesson 49–50","titleEn":"At the Butcher's","titleCn":"在肉店","audio":"media/lessons/nce1/049.mp3","lines":[{"t":3.05,"en":"At the butcher's","cn":"在肉铺里"},{"t":5.66,"en":"Listen to the tape then answer this question.","cn":"先听这段录音，然后再回答这个问题。"},{"t":11.38,"en":"What does Mr. Bird like?","cn":"伯德先生喜欢什么？"},{"t":15.71,"en":"Do you want any meat today, Mrs. Bird?","cn":"伯德夫人，今天您想要吃点肉吗？"},{"t":20.64,"en":"Yes, please.","cn":"好的，请告诉我您需要翻译的内容吧。"},{"t":23.3,"en":"Do you want beef or lamb?","cn":"您想要牛肉还是羊肉？"},{"t":27.05,"en":"Beef, please.","cn":"请给我来一份牛肉。"},{"t":29.77,"en":"This lamb's very good.","cn":"这只小羊非常可爱（或：这只小羊非常棒）。"},{"t":33.75,"en":"I like lamb, but my husband doesn't.","cn":"我喜欢羊肉，但我丈夫不喜欢。"},{"t":38.62,"en":"What about some steak?","cn":"来点牛排怎么样？"},{"t":41.57,"en":"This is a nice piece.","cn":"这是一件很不错的作品。"},{"t":45.0,"en":"Give me that piece, please.","cn":"请给我那块肉。"},{"t":48.27,"en":"And a pound of mince, too.","cn":"还有半磅肉末也给我。"},{"t":52.96,"en":"Do you want a chicken, Mrs. Bird?","cn":"伯德夫人，您想要鸡肉吗？"},{"t":57.46,"en":"They're very nice.","cn":"鸡肉非常美味。"},{"t":59.88,"en":"No, thank you.","cn":"不用了，谢谢。"},{"t":62.23,"en":"My husband likes steak,","cn":"我丈夫喜欢牛排，"},{"t":65.05,"en":"but he doesn't like chicken.","cn":"但他不喜欢鸡肉。"},{"t":68.64,"en":"To tell you the truth, Mrs. Bird,","cn":"说实话，伯德夫人，"},{"t":72.97,"en":"I don't like chicken either!","cn":"我也不喜欢鸡肉！"}],"words":[{"word":"butcher","phonetic":["'butʃə"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"卖肉的","us":"media/words/nce1/w0357_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0357_e.mp3"},{"word":"meat","phonetic":["mi:t"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"(食用)肉","us":"media/words/nce1/w0358_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0358_e.mp3"},{"word":"beef","phonetic":["bi:f"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"牛肉","us":"media/words/nce1/w0359_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0359_e.mp3"},{"word":"lamb","phonetic":["læm"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"羔羊肉","us":"media/words/nce1/w0360_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0360_e.mp3"},{"word":"hus